{"4305260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lots of Bugs", "steam_appid": 4305260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4779030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/347d73bb6477622a597a00bacb82647a.poster.avif?t=1785247294\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/347d73bb6477622a597a00bacb82647a.webm?t=1785247294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/347d73bb6477622a597a00bacb82647a.mp4?t=1785247294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Welcome to Lots of Bugs!</strong><br>Put down your problems and pick up a shell. No deadlines, no stress, just lots of bugs, <br>some  questionable minigames, and one very legendary Pickle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/1741ab5de4593ac4a4bd325994871c51.avif?t=1785247294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras_big/1741ab5de4593ac4a4bd325994871c51.avif?t=1785247294 width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Time to explore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your Pickle Scout journal is ready,</strong> and there is a whole world waiting to be explored. There is so much to find, collect and discover as you follow in the footsteps of the legendary Pickle. <br>The beetle who saved the world and was never seen again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/e9466e7b349f5287b64bfbb25318b19e.avif?t=1785247294\" width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Style your beetle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Show the beetle world who you are. Customise your beetle, choose your style, and paint your own unique design directly onto your shell. Stand out, blend in, or just draw something silly on your back. <br>Because every beetle deserves to feel like themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/55b4445a3680d1db869070a09bce237e.avif?t=1785247294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras_big/55b4445a3680d1db869070a09bce237e.avif?t=1785247294 width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play together</strong><br>Lots of Bugs is a complete adventure on its own... but everything is better with more beetles. Grab a friend and explore together. Even Pickle had a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/be283aad863a23f8cd4be21533acff5c.avif?t=1785247294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras_big/be283aad863a23f8cd4be21533acff5c.avif?t=1785247294 width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find your thing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lots of Bugs is full of things to do beyond exploring. Take part in silly minigames, play and create music, and uncover activities tucked away across the beetle world. The more you look, the more you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/01cb4879a08102415f4435864f5121b0.avif?t=1785247294\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras_big/01cb4879a08102415f4435864f5121b0.avif?t=1785247294 width=1560 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The beetle world is young, growing, and absolutely full of bugs. New areas, activities and secrets are on the way, and we cannot wait to share them with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Add it to your wishlist and come get your bug on!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/347d73bb6477622a597a00bacb82647a.poster.avif?t=1785247294\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/347d73bb6477622a597a00bacb82647a.webm?t=1785247294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305260/extras/347d73bb6477622a597a00bacb82647a.mp4?t=1785247294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Welcome to Lots of Bugs!</strong><br>Put down your problems and pick up a shell. No deadlines, no stress, just lots of bugs, <br>some  questionable minigames, and one very legendary Pickle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ct